Newsreader and Public Sans are both licensed under the SIL Open Font License,
Version 1.1, which permits bundling them with this software.

  Newsreader   — Production Type, https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Newsreader
  Public Sans  — USWDS,           https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Public+Sans

Both files here are the latin subset of the variable font, taken from Google
Fonts. They are carried in the bundle rather than fetched at run time for two
reasons: the panel's Content-Security-Policy is `font-src 'self'`, and a panel
is often reached on a private network with no route out to a font host.

The full licence text travels with each family upstream:
https://openfontlicense.org
